Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Zenith's radar turns again and the podcast's steps light
 in blue: no two @keyframes share a name (audit PM-4; needs author approval)

The chips' light sweep was also called family-sweep and replaced the radar's turn everywhere, so the radar faded out
over 6 s and popped back; the gold step-reach of Start here replaced the podcast's blue one. Renamed chip-sweep and
start-reach; the turn applies to the planet drawing's radar only (the radar behind a Zenith tool stands still, as its
own sweep turns inside it).

